-- Income Tax Act 1947 — TESTS OF THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL: whole taxpayer-years,
-- worked by hand through ss 2, 10, 13, 35, 37-43, 92L, 85 and 87.

§ `Tests — the top-level goal`

-- YA 2025: employment 120,000; a foreign dividend of 10,000 received (s 13(7A)); a Singapore dividend of 5,000 (s 13(1)(za)); reliefs 1,000 + CPF 20,400
`a resident employee` MEANS `Taxpayer year` WITH
    `year of assessment` IS 2025
    `kind of person` IS `an individual`
    `residence` IS (`Residence facts` WITH `resides in Singapore, except reasonable temporary absences` IS TRUE, `days physically present in Singapore` IS 365, `days exercising an employment in Singapore, other than as a director` IS 250, `control and management of the business exercised in Singapore` IS FALSE)
    `income` IS LIST (`Income item` WITH `description` IS "salary", `head` IS `(b) gains or profits from employment`, `source` IS `accruing in or derived from Singapore`, `gross amount` IS 120000, `deductions` IS 0, `exemption claim` IS NOTHING), (`Income item` WITH `description` IS "foreign dividend", `head` IS `(d) dividends, interest or discounts`, `source` IS `received in Singapore from outside Singapore`, `gross amount` IS 10000, `deductions` IS 0, `exemption claim` IS (JUST (`Exemption claim` WITH `ground` IS `s 13(7A) foreign income received by an individual`, `facts` IS (`Exemption facts` WITH `recipient` IS `an individual`, `recipient resident in Singapore` IS TRUE, `received through a partnership in Singapore` IS FALSE, `derived from carrying on a trade, business or profession` IS FALSE, `derived or paid on` IS YMD 2025 6 1, `the payer is a company resident in Singapore` IS FALSE, `the recipient has a business or PE in Singapore` IS FALSE, `days employment exercised in Singapore` IS 0, `as a director of a company` IS FALSE, `as a public entertainer not substantially supported from foreign public funds` IS FALSE, `subject to tax in the territory it comes from` IS FALSE, `that territory's headline corporate rate` IS 0, `the Comptroller is satisfied the exemption is beneficial` IS TRUE, `the s 13(9)(a) condition waived` IS FALSE, `on a Singapore ship, exercised substantially outside Singapore` IS FALSE, `amount of the income` IS 0, `an approval or prescription covers the income` IS FALSE, `the conditions of the paragraph are met` IS FALSE, `the beneficiary's share would be exempt if received directly` IS FALSE)))), (`Income item` WITH `description` IS "local dividend", `head` IS `(d) dividends, interest or discounts`, `source` IS `accruing in or derived from Singapore`, `gross amount` IS 5000, `deductions` IS 0, `exemption claim` IS (JUST (`Exemption claim` WITH `ground` IS `s 13(1)(za) dividend from a company resident in Singapore`, `facts` IS (`Exemption facts` WITH `recipient` IS `an individual`, `recipient resident in Singapore` IS TRUE, `received through a partnership in Singapore` IS FALSE, `derived from carrying on a trade, business or profession` IS FALSE, `derived or paid on` IS YMD 2025 6 1, `the payer is a company resident in Singapore` IS TRUE, `the recipient has a business or PE in Singapore` IS FALSE, `days employment exercised in Singapore` IS 0, `as a director of a company` IS FALSE, `as a public entertainer not substantially supported from foreign public funds` IS FALSE, `subject to tax in the territory it comes from` IS FALSE, `that territory's headline corporate rate` IS 0, `the Comptroller is satisfied the exemption is beneficial` IS TRUE, `the s 13(9)(a) condition waived` IS FALSE, `on a Singapore ship, exercised substantially outside Singapore` IS FALSE, `amount of the income` IS 0, `an approval or prescription covers the income` IS FALSE, `the conditions of the paragraph are met` IS FALSE, `the beneficiary's share would be exempt if received directly` IS FALSE))))
    `capital allowances available` IS 0
    `losses brought forward` IS 0
    `donation deductions available` IS 0
    `same shareholders test met, or not a company` IS TRUE
    `relief facts` IS JUST (`Individual relief facts` WITH `earned income` IS 120000, `age reached by 31 December of the preceding year` IS 40, `totally blind or permanently and severely disabled` IS FALSE, `a female claimant (married, divorced or widowed)` IS FALSE, `had a spouse living with or maintained by the claimant` IS FALSE, `spouse's income in the preceding year` IS 0, `spouse incapacitated by physical or mental infirmity` IS FALSE, `payments to a former spouse under a court order or deed` IS 0, `children` IS EMPTY, `life insurance premiums, capped at 7% of the capital sum` IS 0, `obligatory CPF or approved fund contributions as an employee` IS 20400, `self-employed: assessable income from the trade or profession` IS 0, `self-employed: obligatory CPF contributions on that income` IS 0, `self-employed: voluntary CPF contributions` IS 0, `dependants` IS EMPTY, `incapacitated siblings maintained` IS 0, `course fees` IS 0, `national service` IS `not an operationally ready national serviceman`, `wife or widow of an NSman, claiming` IS FALSE, `parent of an NSman, claiming` IS FALSE, `SRS contributions` IS 0, `SRS contribution cap` IS 15300, `SRS account suspended, or the contribution withdrawn in the year` IS FALSE, `grandparent caregiver: the caregiver's trade or employment income` IS NOTHING, `CPF cash top-ups for family, after grants and capped as prescribed` IS 0, `CPF cash top-ups for self, after grants and capped as prescribed` IS 0, `prescribed deduction limit for s 39(3)` IS 8000, `prescribed deduction limit for s 39(3A)` IS 8000, `foreign domestic worker levy paid, for one worker` IS 0)
